  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Debug a While Loop Flowchart\r\n\r\nThis flowchart models a while loop that ends the game when the player runs out of lives. But somehow the player seems to have infinite lives...\r\n \r\nTrace through the **while loop** flowchart to find the **start condition**, **stop condition**, and **state variable**. Use the debugging checklist to revise the flowchart by updating at least one of these values to ensure the loop runs correctly. \r\n\r\n::: details [<i class=\"fa fa-clipboard\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Debugging Checklist**]\r\n- Does the start value trigger the loop to run?\r\n- Does the state variable ever change?\r\n- Does the loop eventually stop?\r\n:::\r\n&nbsp",
